title: vsub with a denormal exact difference gives a zero of the result's sign
ref: A2.7 FPSub(), FPRound(): with FPSCR = 0x03000000 on iOS (DN, FZ, round to nearest; ADR 0022) a result whose exponent is below the minimum is FPZero(sign)

[code]
30ee601a    vsub.f32 s2, s0, s1
70eec01a    vsub.f32 s3, s1, s0
34ee453b    vsub.f64 d3, d4, d5
7047        bx lr

[in]
s0 = 0x00800001
s1 = 0x00800000
d4 = 0x0010000000000001
d5 = 0x0010000000000000

[out]
s2 = 0x00000000
s3 = 0x80000000
d3 = 0
